<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='3842531715651010917'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=541" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=541" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=541" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=541"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=541"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=541"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=541"></script><script>EC.version='541'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">ADMIT 2026: 2026 5th International Conference on Algorithms, Data Mining, and Information Technology</div><div id="cfpvenue">Wuhan</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Wuhan, China, October 16-18, 2026</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.admit2026.net/" target="_blank">https://www.admit2026.net/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Abstract registration deadline</td><td>September 20, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>September 30, 2026</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=183758" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_red bg_yellow">data mining and knowledge discovery</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=17577365" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_carmin bg_powderblue">machine learning and artificial intelligence</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=1856" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_black bg_haki">information systems</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=28344" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_blue bg_darkyellow">algorithm design and analysis</span></a></div><p>With our great pleasure we announce <strong>2026 5th International Conference on Algorithms, Data Mining, and Information Technology (ADMIT 2026)</strong> will be held in <strong>Wuhan, China</strong> during <strong>October 16-18, 2026</strong>. ADMIT 2026 is organized by <strong>School of Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence, Wuhan University of Technology, China ; sponsored by IEEE, IEEE Wuhan Section, and The International Society for Applied Computing (ISAC)</strong>.</p><p>ADMIT conference will be held annually to provide an interactive forum for presentation and discussion on Algorithms, Data Mining, Information Technology and related fields. Aside from researchers in China, the conference group welcomes participants from all over the world who are interested in developing professional ties to and/or exploring career opportunities in the region. The conference should serve as an ideal forum to establish relationships from within China and other countries of the world.We hope you will join us in Wuhan, China for ADMIT 2026.</p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p>All papers must be original and not simultaneously submitted to another journal or conference. The following paper categories are welcome:</p><ul><li>All manuscripts must not be less than 5 pages in length. If your paper exceeds 6 pages in length, you need to pay for the additional pages.</li><li>Manuscripts should pay attention to originality, report unpublished research results or experimental results. Before submitting, plagiarism checks should be conducted through CrossCheck, Turnitin, or other query systems, with no more than 25% repeat rate.</li></ul><h2>List of Topics</h2><p>We solicit original papers including but not limited to:​​</p><ul><li><p>Topic 1: Algorithm Design and Analysis</p></li><li><p>Topic 2: Data Mining and Knowledge Discovery</p></li><li><p>Topic 3: Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence</p></li><li><p>Topic 4: Information Systems and Big Data Technologies</p></li><li><p>Topic 5: Applications and Emerging IT Trends</p></li></ul><h2>Publication</h2><p>All accepted papers will be included in ADMIT 2026 Conference Proceedings and published by <strong>IEEE</strong>, which will be archived in <strong>IEEE Xplore, and indexed by Ei Compendex, Scopus and CPCI (ISTP)</strong>.</p><h2>Venue</h2><p>The conference will be held in Wuhan, China</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For any inquiry about the submission and conference, please feel free to contact us at Tel/Wechat: +86 19382234810 (Ms. Brandy)</p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
